  <!--
    Output layout, shared by all configs via the $(Configuration) macro:
    build\<Config>\x64\emot3.dll, intermediates in build\<Config>\x64\obj\.
    Per-config folders give each config its own incremental-build database,
    so switching configs doesn't force a full rebuild.
  -->
